## Requirement 5: Credential Redaction

### Redaction Pipeline Position

```
Request → L5 Redaction → L1 Scan → L2 Scan → L3 Scan → L4 Scan → Vault Injection → Tool Execution
              ↑                                                           ↑
        Happens FIRST                                              Happens AFTER scanning
        (before any scanning)                                      (secrets never in logs)
```

**Why L5 happens first:**
1. Prevents credentials from being in scanner logs
2. Scanners work on redacted text (safer)
3. Vault injection happens after scanning (replaces vault refs, not redacted creds)

